---@field peak_memory_bytes number Peak memory the query has reserved, in bytes.
---@field processed_input_rows number Rows the query has read.
---@field progress_percentage number|distilled.Null Best-effort progress percentage, or null when Trino cannot estimate it.
---@field blocked boolean Whether all of the query's work is waiting on data or metadata.

